($ii$)$2017|x_1+...+x_{100}$;
($iii$)$2017|x_1^2+...+x_{100}^2$.

In the sum shown, each letter represents a different digit with $T \neq 0$ and $W \neq 0$. How many different values of $U$ are possible? 

